{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 150776, "name": "lordpipe", "username": "lordpipe", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/{size}/10071_2.png", "created_at": "2022-10-07T18:16:15.925Z", "cooked": "<p>I’ve been encountering this strange issue. I’m using a setup similar to Fedora KDE spin. <strong>Before a few weeks ago, Flatpaks would use the Qt file picker with a dark theme. Now they are suddenly using the GTK file picker with a light theme.</strong> I suspect this has to do with <code>xdg-desktop-portal-kde</code> somehow being replaced with <code>xdg-desktop-portal-gnome</code>, but I can’t figure out how to change it back.</p>\n<p>This is extremely frustrating because the GTK file picker is badly handi-capped compared to the Qt one, and everything was working fine before.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/b/1/b15029514862c269c99a9f8c5b0512ae27b8d315.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/piAfWWvZJ9QI3jhEOx3Tncblcpf.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"b15029514862c269c99a9f8c5b0512ae27b8d315.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/b/1/b15029514862c269c99a9f8c5b0512ae27b8d315_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"b15029514862c269c99a9f8c5b0512ae27b8d315.jpeg\" data-base62-sha1=\"piAfWWvZJ9QI3jhEOx3Tncblcpf\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/b/1/b15029514862c269c99a9f8c5b0512ae27b8d315_2_690x388.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/b/1/b15029514862c269c99a9f8c5b0512ae27b8d315_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/b/1/b15029514862c269c99a9f8c5b0512ae27b8d315_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"85728E\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">b15029514862c269c99a9f8c5b0512ae27b8d315.jpeg</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 99.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Additionally, some Flatpaks are completely stuck on light theme, such as Calibre.</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-06-22T19:28:12.438Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 2225, "reads": 46, "readers_count": 45, "score": 11154.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 70249, "topic_slug": "flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back", "display_username": "lordpipe", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 3, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/b/1/b15029514862c269c99a9f8c5b0512ae27b8d315.jpeg", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "b15029514862c269c99a9f8c5b0512ae27b8d315.jpeg", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 12298, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back/70249/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 191517, "name": "dalto", "username": "dalto", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/dalto/{size}/5564_2.png", "created_at": "2022-10-07T19:14:13.251Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"lordpipe\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"70249\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/48/10071_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lordpipe:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I suspect this has to do with <code>xdg-desktop-portal-kde</code> somehow being replaced with <code>xdg-desktop-portal-gnome</code>, but I can’t figure out how to change it back.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That is almost definitely the issue.</p>\n<p>What happens if you <code>sudo dnf install xdg-desktop-portal-kde</code></p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T22:45:40.979Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 32, "reads": 38, "readers_count": 37, "score": 172.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 70249, "topic_slug": "flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back", "display_username": "dalto", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 3609, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back/70249/2", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 195465, "name": "lordpipe", "username": "lordpipe", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/{size}/10071_2.png", "created_at": "2022-10-07T19:18:05.866Z", "cooked": "<p><code>xdg-desktop-portal-kde</code> is already installed.</p>\n<p>Attempting to remove <code>xdg-desktop-portal-gnome</code> tries to remove GTK4. Removing <code>xdg-desktop-portal-gtk</code> succeeds, but doesn’t fix the issue.</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T08:01:03.988Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 22, "reads": 37, "readers_count": 36, "score": 137.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 70249, "topic_slug": "flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back", "display_username": "lordpipe", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 3295, "username": "jimbo2150", "name": "Jim", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/jimbo2150/{size}/5153_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 12298, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back/70249/3", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 163870, "name": "dalto", "username": "dalto", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/dalto/{size}/5564_2.png", "created_at": "2022-10-07T19:22:57.052Z", "cooked": "<p>Is it removing <code>gtk4</code> because it is an unused dependency?</p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:48:24.303Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 3, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 23, "reads": 37, "readers_count": 36, "score": 127.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 70249, "topic_slug": "flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back", "display_username": "dalto", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 12298, "username": "lordpipe", "name": "lordpipe", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/{size}/10071_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 3609, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back/70249/4", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 157267, "name": "lordpipe", "username": "lordpipe", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/{size}/10071_2.png", "created_at": "2022-10-07T19:31:24.757Z", "cooked": "<p>Oh, it was! Not sure how I missed that.</p>\n<p>So the solution was</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-bash\">dnf remove xdg-desktop-portal-gnome\n</code></pre>\n<p>Note to anyone trying to remove <code>xdg-desktop-portal-gnome</code> — I had to relog after doing it. It will be broken until you log back into your session.</p>\n<p>This fixed the file picker, but for some reason the KDE Qt theme is still not applying for some flatpaks, such as Calibre.</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:45:48.483Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": 4, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 56, "reads": 37, "readers_count": 36, "score": 297.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 70249, "topic_slug": "flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back", "display_username": "lordpipe", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 3295, "username": "jimbo2150", "name": "Jim", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/jimbo2150/{size}/5153_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 12298, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back/70249/5", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 190172, "name": "lordpipe", "username": "lordpipe", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/{size}/10071_2.png", "created_at": "2022-10-07T19:34:30.410Z", "cooked": "<p>It appears Qt theme is getting applied for Qt5 applications but not Qt6. And because the KDE file picker used by portals is Qt6, it doesn’t get a theme applied no matter what app.</p>\n<p>I’m perplexed here. Just trying to get Breeze-Dark theming working inside Flatpak like it was working before. Unfortunately I don’t have any clue what caused this to begin with, other than an update I did a few weeks ago.</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:58:51.493Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 28, "reads": 35, "readers_count": 34, "score": 152.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 70249, "topic_slug": "flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back", "display_username": "lordpipe", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 4, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 12298, "username": "lordpipe", "name": "lordpipe", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/{size}/10071_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 12298, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back/70249/6", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 198984, "name": "dalto", "username": "dalto", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/dalto/{size}/5564_2.png", "created_at": "2022-10-07T19:52:23.196Z", "cooked": "<p>As far as I know, plasma doesn’t have full theming integration support for qt6 yet.</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T08:02:31.443Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 6, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 39, "reads": 36, "readers_count": 35, "score": 207.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 70249, "topic_slug": "flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back", "display_username": "dalto", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 12298, "username": "lordpipe", "name": "lordpipe", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/{size}/10071_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 3609, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back/70249/7", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 196815, "name": "lordpipe", "username": "lordpipe", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/{size}/10071_2.png", "created_at": "2022-10-07T19:57:47.475Z", "cooked": "<p>I’m not sure what this means. Everything worked perfectly before, including theme changes for Qt6 apps under Flatpak. Should be able to go back to the old behavior, unless something has actually been removed from upstream.</p>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T08:01:37.537Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 7, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 45, "reads": 37, "readers_count": 36, "score": 232.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 70249, "topic_slug": "flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back", "display_username": "lordpipe", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 3295, "username": "jimbo2150", "name": "Jim", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/jimbo2150/{size}/5153_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 12298, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back/70249/8", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 205938, "name": "lordpipe", "username": "lordpipe", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/{size}/10071_2.png", "created_at": "2022-10-07T20:01:43.456Z", "cooked": "<p>Possibly related bug report page: <a href=\"https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=458865\" class=\"inline-onebox\">458865 – After an update to qt5-base the dolphin file picker dialog used in GTK applications via GTK_USE_PORTAL=1 ignores theming</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Here is a “work around”:</strong></p>\n<p>add <code>XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP=KDE</code> to <code>/etc/environment</code> and reboot.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Still unable to get Qt6 themes in Calibre, but the file picker is now using the correct theme.</p>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T08:05:23.193Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 45, "reads": 37, "readers_count": 36, "score": 232.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 70249, "topic_slug": "flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back", "display_username": "lordpipe", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=458865", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "458865 – After an update to qt5-base the dolphin file picker dialog used in GTK applications via GTK_USE_PORTAL=1 ignores theming", "clicks": 36}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 12298, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back/70249/9", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 476378, "name": "Mr Beedell, Roke Julian Lockhart", "username": "rokejulianlockhart", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/rokejulianlockhart/{size}/52169_2.png", "created_at": "2026-02-06T16:32:42.218Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group quote-modified\" data-username=\"lordpipe\" data-post=\"5\" data-topic=\"70249\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/lordpipe/48/10071_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lordpipe:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"sh\"><code class=\"lang-sh\">#!/usr/bin/env sh\nsudo dnf remove xdg-desktop-portal-gnome\n</code></pre>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I appear to be experiencing this, for although I’d considered <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1658011#c11\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><code>bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1658011#c11</code></a> to be a fluke, <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/inkscape/inbox/-/issues/783#note_2408278210\"><code>gitlab.com/inkscape/inbox/-/issues/783#note_2408278210</code></a> demonstrates that this shouldn’t be occurring in <code>inkscape-1.4.3-1.fc43</code> as well, yet is:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/a/a/aa9ed08e85a50a1cf9e5d0f673775d6e13f14b2d.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/olnqAup3Ywe21v6qLRUug1zEYa1.png?dl=1\" title=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/a/a/aa9ed08e85a50a1cf9e5d0f673775d6e13f14b2d_2_445x500.png\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"olnqAup3Ywe21v6qLRUug1zEYa1\" width=\"445\" height=\"500\" role=\"presentation\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/a/a/aa9ed08e85a50a1cf9e5d0f673775d6e13f14b2d_2_445x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/a/a/aa9ed08e85a50a1cf9e5d0f673775d6e13f14b2d_2_667x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/a/a/aa9ed08e85a50a1cf9e5d0f673775d6e13f14b2d_2_890x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EDEDED\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1282×1440 132 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Unfortunately, I cannot remove <code>xdg-desktop-portal-gtk</code>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"sh\"><code class=\"lang-sh\">#!/usr/bin/env sh\nrun0 dnf5 remove xdg-desktop-portal-gtk-1.15.3-2.fc43.x86_64\n</code></pre>\n</li>\n<li>\n<blockquote>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"YAML\"><code class=\"lang-YAML\">Failed to resolve the transaction:\nProblem: installed package plasma-workspace-6.5.5-1.fc43.x86_64 requires xdg-desktop-portal-kde, but none of the providers can be installed\n  - installed package xdg-desktop-portal-kde-6.5.5-1.fc43.x86_64 requires xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, but none of the providers can be installed\n  - installed package plasma-desktop-6.5.5-1.fc43.x86_64 requires plasma-workspace, but none of the providers can be installed\n  - conflicting requests\n  - problem with installed package\n</code></pre>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4><a name=\"p-476378-my-environment-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-476378-my-environment-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>My Environment</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"sh\"><code class=\"lang-sh\">#!/usr/bin/env sh\nrpm -qa | grep portal\n</code></pre>\n</li>\n<li>\n<blockquote>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"log\"><code class=\"lang-log\">xdg-desktop-portal-1.20.3-2.fc43.x86_64\nxdg-desktop-portal-gtk-1.15.3-2.fc43.x86_64\nxdg-desktop-portal-kde-6.5.5-1.fc43.x86_64\n</code></pre>\n</blockquote></li>\n</ol>", "post_number": 10, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2026-02-06T16:34:46.724Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 50, "reads": 19, "readers_count": 18, "score": 253.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 70249, "topic_slug": "flatpak-applications-are-suddenly-using-the-gtk-file-picker-instead-of-qt-how-do-i-change-it-back", "display_username": "Mr Beedell, Roke Julian Lockhart", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://gitlab.com/inkscape/inbox/-/issues/783#note_2408278210", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "use xdg-desktop-portal for native file chooser (#783) · Issues · Inkscape / Inbox · GitLab", "clicks": 0}, {"url": "https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1658011#c11", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "1658011 - [flatpak] Use file chooser portal", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": "", "repl